 of magic, which breaks enchantment down into sequences of code. That'll be quite a task, given that so far Koyomi's talent seems to consist of making washbasins randomly fall out of the sky. But if it was easy, it wouldn't be magic, would it?\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Idol","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Software Development","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Modern Magic Made Simple","english":"Modern Magic Made Simple","native":"よくわかる現代魔法","romaji":"Yokuwakaru Gendaimahou","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"简单易懂的现代魔法"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}